    "0aa96139-5b59-4ced-a8c7-2fa5c1bc0836": {
      "type": "featured-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "090a05a9-c530-405c-8480-12d5b201f814": {
          "type": "entry",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is my order?",
            "text": "<p>Orders placed before 12pm, Monday to Friday, are usually dispatched the same day. Orders placed after 12pm will be dispatched the following working day. <br/><br/>Fast 24 hour Delivery - Appliances<br/><br/>As standard, delivery for purchases that include appliances will usually be made 24 hours after dispatch on weekdays. If you place an order for an appliance after 12pm on a Friday, delivery will be made on the following Tuesday.<br/><br/>Standard 48 hour Delivery - Accessories<br/><br/>Delivery for orders of accessories only will usually be made 48 hours after dispatch on weekdays.<br/><br/>Please expect delays around public and bank holidays. See the delivery page for specific information.<br/><br/>To check the delivery status of your order, log into the My Account section of our website and click on the tracking link provided. </p>",
            "button_1_style": "white",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "white",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
            "product_specifications": "",
